{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521846001:1":{"text":"...비보 선생님.","source_cn":"……比博老师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x428A4F73E2D2F56B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521846002:1":{"text":"아반드 님, 저는 두루마리를 가져왔습니다. 페르세우스가 젊은 시절에 가장 즐겨 읽었던 전술이 적혀 있지요.","source_cn":"殿下，我带来了一份卷轴。珀尔修斯年轻时，最喜欢阅读其上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C3325AD219B2A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"비보가 준 두루마리","source_cn":"比博给的卷轴","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224C8AE13DFF3F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521846003:1":{"text":"부디 이걸 페르세우스와 함께 묻어주십시오.","source_cn":"就请让它陪伴珀尔修斯长眠吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680BEDF8C44049E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521846004:1":{"text":"응...","source_cn":"……嗯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC970D8D7A9ECFD3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521846005:0":{"text":"선생님... 저, 반드시 영주의 책임을 다해서 다시는 전쟁이 일어나지 않게 할게요. 선생님에게 다시는 제자를 잃는 고통을 드리지 않겠어요.","source_cn":"老师……我会努力承担起领主的职责，不再让战争重演，也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36EA45A9F9D4A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521846006:0":{"text":"아쿠보르와의 화해는 첫걸음일 뿐... 다시는 보칼리스에 재앙이 찾아오지 않도록 할게요!","source_cn":"和雅库伯尔的和解只是第一步……我不会再让呼临城遭受灾难！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC52ED99DA3D8502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521846007:1":{"text":"...네, 믿겠습니다. 아반드 님은 분명 하실 수 있어요.","source_cn":"……好。我相信你，你一定可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F0724C54C4BE2D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1521846008:1":{"text":"장례식이 시작되자, 병사들이 페르세우스의 관을 무덤 속으로 내렸다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928D925E929884D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1521846009:1":{"text":"수많은 사람들이 다녀가면서, 페르세우스의 무덤 앞은 추모의 물건들로 가득 차게 되었다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A60854CED5E74BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1521846010:1":{"text":"비록 더는 만날 수 없지만, 페르세우스는 영원히 보칼리스와 함께할 것이다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97493C6F0F1831A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:领主阿邦德":{"text":"영주 아반드","source":"领主阿邦德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:学者比博":{"text":"학자 비보","source":"学者比博","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"블랙 스크린","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":3}}